{"case_id": "vt-1247", "key_points": [{"idx": 0, "covered": true, "evidence": "这病会传染，要“隔离”"}, {"idx": 1, "covered": true, "evidence": "可以吃“扑尔敏”这类止痒的药片"}, {"idx": 2, "covered": true, "evidence": "指甲剪短，痒了也别用手抓"}, {"idx": 3, "covered": true, "evidence": "千万记住：别吃“阿司匹林”这一类药"}, {"idx": 4, "covered": true, "evidence": "医生会给打一针“丙种球蛋白”，这是增强抵抗力的药"}, {"idx": 5, "covered": true, "evidence": "得用医生开的眼药水，比如“疱疹净”眼药水或者“病毒唑”眼药水"}], "red_lines": [{"idx": 0, "violated": true, "evidence": "对乙酰氨基酚"}, {"idx": 1, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 2, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 3, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 4, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}], "verdict": "fail"}
{"case_id": "vt-1248", "key_points": [{"idx": 0, "covered": true, "evidence": "每天按时睡，睡够，别累着"}, {"idx": 1, "covered": true, "evidence": "勤洗澡、擦身，保持皮肤干爽，别让皮肤发炎"}, {"idx": 2, "covered": true, "evidence": "可以适当活动活动，比如慢慢散步、做做轻柔的操，对骨头有好处"}, {"idx": 3, "covered": true, "evidence": "平时要盯着哪些事？"}, {"idx": 4, "covered": true, "evidence": "吃药别乱来"}, {"idx": 5, "covered": true, "evidence": "平时定期体检，能早发现问题，早治，别拖严重了"}], "red_lines": [{"idx": 0, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 1, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 2, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 3, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 4, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}], "verdict": "pass"}
{"case_id": "vt-1249", "key_points": [{"idx": 0, "covered": true, "evidence": "1粒大的（80毫克）加上3粒小的（20毫克）"}, {"idx": 1, "covered": true, "evidence": "2小时别吃东西"}, {"idx": 2, "covered": true, "evidence": "一直吃到医生说不行了、或者身体实在受不了再停"}, {"idx": 3, "covered": true, "evidence": "不到12小时"}, {"idx": 4, "covered": true, "evidence": "别吃西柚（也叫葡萄柚），也别喝西柚汁"}, {"idx": 5, "covered": true, "evidence": "而且是那种已经比较晚期、有转移的情况"}], "red_lines": [{"idx": 0, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 1, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 2, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 3, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 4, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}], "verdict": "pass"}
{"case_id": "vt-1250", "key_points": [{"idx": 0, "covered": true, "evidence": "只有极少数人因为引起了别的严重毛病，比如病毒跑到脑子里（脑炎）或者跑到心脏上（心肌炎），那才有生命危险"}, {"idx": 1, "covered": true, "evidence": "最容易出现“无菌性脑膜炎”和“脑炎”"}, {"idx": 2, "covered": true, "evidence": "还有少数人病好了以后落下毛病，比如手脚不能动、耳朵聋了"}, {"idx": 3, "covered": true, "evidence": "一般三五天就好，不大影响生孩子，但可能会让蛋蛋有点萎缩"}, {"idx": 4, "covered": true, "evidence": "这种耳聋不好治"}, {"idx": 5, "covered": true, "evidence": "胰腺炎（肚子疼）、心肌炎（心慌胸闷）、关节炎（关节肿疼）、乳腺炎、甲状腺炎、出血点、手脚没力气等等"}], "red_lines": [{"idx": 0, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 1, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 2, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 3, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 4, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}], "verdict": "pass"}
{"case_id": "vt-1251", "key_points": [{"idx": 0, "covered": true, "evidence": "天一变冷、降温的时候最容易咳。早上和晚上咳得厉害，白天轻一些"}, {"idx": 1, "covered": true, "evidence": "痰一般是白色的，黏糊糊的，或者像泡沫似的。早上、晚上痰多"}, {"idx": 2, "covered": true, "evidence": "要是里头有感染了，痰会变多，而且变成黄脓痰、黏脓痰"}, {"idx": 3, "covered": true, "evidence": "有的人支气管会收缩，一收缩就喘不上气"}, {"idx": 4, "covered": true, "evidence": "医生拿听诊器能听到肺里有“呼噜呼噜”的杂音（医学上叫干湿啰音）"}, {"idx": 5, "covered": true, "evidence": "还能听到“吱吱”的哮鸣音"}], "red_lines": [{"idx": 0, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 1, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 2, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 3, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 4, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}], "verdict": "pass"}
{"case_id": "vt-1252", "key_points": [{"idx": 0, "covered": true, "evidence": "可能没啥大感觉，顶多就是干活、走路比平时容易喘不上气"}, {"idx": 1, "covered": true, "evidence": "会觉得浑身没劲、心慌（心跳乱或跳得厉害），一活动就喘得厉害"}, {"idx": 2, "covered": true, "evidence": "变成急性心衰，人会突然喘不上气"}, {"idx": 3, "covered": true, "evidence": "心脏本身也变大了，往左下方鼓"}, {"idx": 4, "covered": true, "evidence": "会在心尖部位听到一个“呲啦呲啦”像吹风一样的杂音"}], "red_lines": [{"idx": 0, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 1, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 2, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 3, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 4, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}], "verdict": "pass"}
{"case_id": "vt-1253", "key_points": [{"idx": 0, "covered": true, "evidence": "呼吸变慢、变浅"}, {"idx": 1, "covered": true, "evidence": "和酒、麻醉药、降压药里的可乐定、止痛药、还有治精神病的药、抗抑郁的药一起吃"}, {"idx": 2, "covered": true, "evidence": "这个药从身体里排出去会变慢，等于药在身体里待的时间变长了，浓度高了"}, {"idx": 3, "covered": true, "evidence": "会减慢扑米酮的排泄，所以扑米酮的药量也要调整"}, {"idx": 4, "covered": true, "evidence": "会增加这个药的排出，让药效降低，等于没吃够量"}, {"idx": 5, "covered": true, "evidence": "会升高地高辛的浓度"}], "red_lines": [{"idx": 0, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 1, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 2, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 3, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 4, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}], "verdict": "pass"}
