{"case_id": "vt-1258", "key_points": [{"idx": 0, "covered": true, "evidence": "保护好腰子（肾脏），别让它出大问题"}, {"idx": 1, "covered": true, "evidence": "等到脚踝、脸这些地方不肿了，血压降下来了，尿里看不到血了，再慢慢下床活动"}, {"idx": 2, "covered": true, "evidence": "肉、蛋、奶这些蛋白质要少吃点"}, {"idx": 3, "covered": true, "evidence": "这病常常是喉咙发炎、扁桃体发炎这种“链球菌感染”引起来的"}, {"idx": 4, "covered": true, "evidence": "尿少、水肿，就“利尿”"}], "red_lines": [{"idx": 0, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 1, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 2, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 3, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}, {"idx": 4, "violated": false, "evidence": ""}], "verdict": "pass"}
